    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2. 在 It is … that 的句型中这三个词都可互用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "It is "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "likely/possible/probable"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " that we shall meet with some difficulty. 我们有可能会遇到一些困难。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "3. 在 It is … for sb. to do sth. 的句型中只能用 possible。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "It is "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "possible"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " for his team to win the game. 他的球队有可能会赢得比赛。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "4. probable 不能与动词不定式连用。"
        }
